{"lyrics":"[00:00.00] [Instrumental Intro]\n[00:09.22] And we sippin' purple, nigga, yeah\n[00:13.90] Honestly, Honestly (Ayy, Southside, Where You Get All That Drip?)\n[00:21.30] Everything I wanna be, gotta work 'til it come to me\n[00:23.06] Ain't wanna be no wannabe, wannabes, they under me\n[00:24.96] Honestly, I wanna be, on the beach, white sand up under me, comfortably (Comfortably)\n[00:27.06] I just want 100 G's (100 G's), foreign V's (Foreign V's)\n[00:29.92] Louis V (Louis V), they like, \"Who is he-he?\" (Who is he?)\n[00:41.84] Honestly, when I was broke as fuck, you ain't notice me *You ain't notice me)\n[00:44.40] You thought days I was posted up at the county jail where I'm 'posed to be\n[00:47.76] Now young nigga eating overly (I'm overly), I got hunnids old as trees (Old as trees)\n[00:51.56] And money don't grow on trees (Money don't grow, ayy), but I'm gon' blow it like leaves, ayy (Blow like leaves, ayy)\n[00:55.80] Pull up with turbo V's, ayy, two-door AMG's, ayy (Ayy)\n[00:58.68] I started witnessing some of the shit that felt like it was make-believe, ayy (Ayy)\n[01:02.12] Lil' nigga neck on freeze, ayy, spent 100 racks on these, ayy\n[01:05.30] Seen't 'em tryna keep up and then lost everything, I can't let that happen to me, ayy\n[01:10.36] Feeling alive, I'm so happy to be, ayy (Ayy)\n[01:13.22] You killing my vibe, fuck how long you bitches you see me, be happy for me, ayy (Ayy)\n[01:16.72] I'm fresh all the time, but you know my kicks ain't Buscemi\n[01:19.04] Capital G Fazos, Nike need me on the payroll, I just took these off a day ago\n[01:24.32] Killers gon' do what I say so, angels gon' give you a halo\n[01:27.82] And we got money to lay low\n[01:29.52] Now when it come to the bread, I go with it like mayo\n[01:32.94] Can't let it go to my head, I had way too many days broke\n[01:37.38] Honestly, Honestly (Ayy, Southside, Where You Get All That Drip?)\n[01:43.50] Everything I wanna be, gotta work 'til it come to me\n[01:46.54] Ain't wanna be no wannabe, wannabes, they under me\n[01:50.40] Honestly, I wanna be, on the beach, white sand up under me, comfortably (Comfortably)\n[01:57.52] I just want 100 G's (100 G's), foreign V's (Foreign V's)\n[02:01.70] Louis V (Louis V), they like, \"Who is he-he?\" (Who is he?)\n[02:05.18] I say honestly, I need honesty (I need honesty)\n[02:08.22] Get rich and I make my mama proud of me (Proud of me)\n[02:11.64] A young rich nigga, that's what I'm 'bout to be (What I'm bout' to be)\n[02:15.26] Rolling gas, boy, yo' shit not loud to me (Got gas)\n[02:18.44] I'm getting used to the fake niggas crowding me (Get back)\n[02:22.32] I got demons and these niggas brought 'em out of me (Get back)\n[02:25.56] I'm on my boss shit, ain't no clowning me (No, ah)\n[02:28.88] Let's fuck up Saks Fifth, hit the town on me (Run it)\n[02:33.18] Me and Herbo pull up in a Bentley coupe (Skrrt, skrrt-skrrt)\n[02:36.54] Ain't no telling what we'll say or what we'll do (Run it, run it, run it)\n[02:39.44] Smoke Gelato out the zip, feel like jet fuel (Run it, run it, run it)\n[02:43.04] We'll never let a fuck nigga know our next move (No)\n[02:46.64] Run up them big bags (Run it), that's what we into (That's what we into)\n[02:49.98] We just some real niggas (Real), look what we been through (Look what we been through)\n[02:53.64] I put Gucci on my backpack (Boujee), but I don't like school (But I don't like school)\n[02:56.86] I know you may love me (Right), but bitch, I don't like you (Like you)\n[03:00.34] Honestly, Honestly (Ayy, Southside, Where You Get All That Drip?)\n[03:07.16] Everything I wanna be, gotta work 'til it come to me\n[03:10.02] Ain't wanna be no wannabe, wannabes, they under me\n[03:13.88] Honestly, I wanna be, on the beach, white sand up under me, comfortably (Comfortably)\n[03:21.00] I just want 100 G's (100 G's), foreign V's (Foreign V's)\n[03:24.70] Louis V (Louis V), they like, \"Who is he-he?\" (Who is he?)","words":[[9.22,9.38,"And"],[9.42,9.46,"we"],[9.6